        "text": "Next, we examined CDK1 expression in the hepatoma cell lines of SK-Hep-1, Huh7, HepG2 and SNU449 and found that both protein levels and mRNA levels of CDK1 were significantly increased compared to normal hepatocytes (Fig.\u00a04C)."
      },
      {
        "sentence": 6,
        "start": 681,
        "end": 787,
        "text": "Meanwhile, we found that KNTC1 was regulating CDK1 levels in HCC through TCGA database analysis (Fig.\u00a04D)."
